    rationale "en" "Two-pass blinded rubric adjudication: both passes accepted this SNOMED CT concept. Evidence: Laboratory measurement: NPU20868 arbitrary substance concentration of erythrocyte anti-Xga blood group antibody in plasma at 37C (designation); 4094442 is an entailed lossy abstraction. Omissions recorded: antibody specificity (anti-Xga), temperature condition (37C), procedural qualifier, specimen (plasma)."
}
